  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גּוֹעֵשׁ בְּכַעֲסִי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קוֹפֵא בְּחֶרְדָתִי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּי הַדָּם הוּא נַפְשִׁי.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַאֲדִים אֶת בֹּשְׁתִּי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פּוֹעֵם בִּלְבָבִי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שׁוֹתֵת בִּשְׁתִיקָתִי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּי הַדָּם הוּא אֲנִי.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אסור לשפוך דם - גם לא ברמז, בלחישה או במקלדת.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אל תפגע באדם אחר - לא באלימות פיזית, ולא במילים מעליבות.<br />פגיעה בנפש = שפיכת דם.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אפילו אם לא רואים את הדם..<span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">.</span></span></span></p><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מי שעוצר בזמן - שולט בנפש.<br data-end=\"125\" data-start=\"122\" />\nמי שלא - נותן לדם לשלוט בו.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\">שלוש פעמים = 876 = בית מקדשך</span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">ובפרשה נאמר:<br />\"שָׁלוֹשׁ פְּעָמִים בַּשָּׁנָה יֵרָאֶה... אֶת פְּנֵי ה' ... בַּמָּקוֹם אֲשֶׁר יִבְחָר\"</span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><br /></span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span>'</span><span><strong data-end=\"289\" data-start=\"261\">וּבִעַרְתָּ</strong>' / '</span><span><strong data-end=\"289\" data-start=\"261\">וּתְפַלֵּי</strong>'</span><br /></span></span><span>❖לסלק, לבער - פּוֹלֶה כִּנִּים</span></li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<strong data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"426\">וְסַרְתֶּם</strong>' / '<strong data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"426\">וְתִסְטוֹן</strong>'<br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span>&nbsp;לעזוב, להתרחק מהמקובל - סטייה</li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<strong data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"570\">צְּבִי</strong>' / '<strong data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"570\">טַבְיָא</strong>'<br /></span>❖&nbsp;<span data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"596\">אותיות צ-ט מתחלפות - כמו קיץ/קיט</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>'<b>מְצַוְּךָ</b>' / '<b>מְפַקֵּיד</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;מצווה, נותן הוראה - פקודה</span></li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<strong data-end=\"900\" data-start=\"858\">מִשְׁלַח (יֶדְכֶם)</strong>' / '<strong data-end=\"900\" data-start=\"858\">אוֹשָׁטוּת (יַדְכוֹן)</strong>'<br /></span>❖ הגשה, נתינה - הושטה</li></ol><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><br /></span></h2><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgoGTor-psHi49TEK-rgPXDYg0FuuBHE5goKL_IkNNSzYXWL3s8bzQn2GySOQoylofkt_3QfX2yxs5gP4-q9Ywoh7aHQ6ANtvWsolo6-x71ZjIIcKfAR5oTMo4X0uKQlTCttn80sJKLKgJYQtq-K77nIn_d1k0BV5Igp2e1rMZtssIc4s4kkomxZNiIh2c/s428/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"428\" data-original-width=\"425\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgoGTor-psHi49TEK-rgPXDYg0FuuBHE5goKL_IkNNSzYXWL3s8bzQn2GySOQoylofkt_3QfX2yxs5gP4-q9Ywoh7aHQ6ANtvWsolo6-x71ZjIIcKfAR5oTMo4X0uKQlTCttn80sJKLKgJYQtq-K77nIn_d1k0BV5Igp2e1rMZtssIc4s4kkomxZNiIh2c/w199-h200/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"199\" /></a></div></div></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עצור לפני שיהיה Too late</span></div></div></div></blockquote>"
